<title>NETHERLANDS: Nutricia sees 1997 profits rising.</title>
<headline>Nutricia sees 1997 profits rising.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food group Nutricia NV said on Thursday it expected its 1997 profits to be significantly increased by further efficiency measures.</p>
<p>&quot;Combined with expected market developments, the results in the current financial year will show a substantial rise, barring unforseen circumstances,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
